<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>기본 홈</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #243024;
  background-color: #eef3ec;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(#b7c5b4 0.7px, transparent 0.8px),
    radial-gradient(#ffffff 0.7px, transparent 0.8px);
  background-size: 12px 12px, 17px 17px;
  background-position: 0 0, 5px 8px;
}
header { padding: 22px 10%; background: #2f5d50; color: white; }
main { max-width: 900px; margin: 90px auto; padding: 42px; }
.card {
  padding: 38px;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(35,65,45,.18);
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
}
h1 { margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 2.3rem; }
p { line-height: 1.7; }
button { margin-top: 25px; padding: 12px 22px; border: 0; border-radius: 9px; background: #4f826a; color: white; cursor: pointer; }
button:hover { background: #35604d; }
</style>
</head>
<body><header><h2>GREEN HOME</h2></header>
<main><section class="card"><h1>환영합니다</h1><p>자연스러운 텍스처가 적용된 기본 홈 화면입니다.</p><button>시작하기</button></section></main>
</body>
</html>
